DEMO   ENGLISH   CONFIG (1.0)
  ROOTCAT S .
  FILES .
  LEXENTRIES (DEMO LANGUAGE).
  TEMPLATES (DEMO LANGUAGE). 
  RULES (DEMO LANGUAGE).
  GOVERNABLERELATIONS    SUBJ OBJ OBJ2 OBL.
  SEMANTICFUNCTIONS    ADJUNCT  TOPIC FOCUS POSS STANDARD.
  NONDISTRIBUTIVES    NUM PERS CONJ-FORM COORD-FORM.
  EPSILON   e.
  OPTIMALITYORDER NOGOOD.

----

DEMO   LANGUAGE   RULES (1.0)
	
S --> NP+: @GFN,
      PP*: {
	    (^ OBL-DI) = !
	    (! PFORM) =c di
	   |
	    ! $ (^ ADJUNCT)
	    (! PTYPE) =c sem
	   };
      VP.

NP --> N: ^=!.

PP --> { P: ^=!
	   (! PTYPE) =c sem;
	 NP: (^ OBJ) = !
       |
	 P: ^=!
	   (! PTYPE) =c nosem;
         NP
       }.

VP --> V.

----

DEMO LANGUAGE TEMPLATES (1.0)

GFN = { (^ SUBJ) = !
      | (^ OBJ) = !
      }.

OPT-TRANS(P) = { (^ PRED) = 'P<(^SUBJ)(^OBJ)>'
	       | (^ PRED) = 'P<(^SUBJ)>' }.

DITRANS(P) = @(DAT-SHIFT (^ PRED)='P<(^ SUBJ)(^ OBJ)(^ OBL-DI)>').

DAT-SHIFT(SCHEMATA) = { SCHEMATA 
	                 | SCHEMATA 
	                 (^ OBJ)-->(^ OBJ2)
	                 (^ OBL-DI)-->(^ OBJ)}.

----

DEMO LANGUAGE LEXICON (1.0)

"nouns"

tam	N * (^ PRED) = 'tam'.

plim	N * (^ PRED) = 'plim'.

tipf	N * (^ PRED) = 'tipf'.

bobo	N * (^ PRED) = 'bobo'.

"verbs"

taotao	V * @(OPT-TRANS taotao). "eat"

guagua	V * @(DITRANS guagua). "give"

"prepositions"

ya 	P * (^ PRED) = 'ya<(^ OBJ)>' 
	    (^ PTYPE) = sem.        "in"

di 	P * (^ PFORM) = 'di'
	    (^ PTYPE) = nosem.      "to"

----
